{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:39 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:39 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:39 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"蜂巢跌下，嚇煞大廈住戶。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/071527df85400eef8c8043d56fc55e86/2026-10/page_158.jpg\"/><p>今日（21日）早上8時39分，跑馬地禮頓道32至34A號星華大廈有住戶報案，指發現一個起火的蜂巢從天而降，跌在其單位外的冷氣機頂，懷疑發生火警。據報蜂巢跌落後，群蜂亂竄飛舞，狀甚嚇人。警方及消防員趕到，但沒有發現煙火。現場所見，大廈後巷對上3樓簷篷殘留部分蜂巢。人員經調查將案件列作誤會，其後收隊離場。</p><img alt=\"3樓簷篷殘留部分蜂巢。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40e7bea0e197a6ae56e7f548d2779673/2026-10/5_7.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22716f7c7f8fc5cbd9938fe01a678c61/2026-10/3_0_12.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/55e07e4245afdb02fa4edbf69ec78f3a/2026-10/4_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是星華大廈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2fc501157183e6ba069c1cb680fbb10/2026-10/1_1_25.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/457605cef7584fe8553c35c2c20d1bb6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_10_06_05.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/57c04584df2298147894bf460fa020d5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-21_at_10_06_04_3_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:34.646343+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":234,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:39:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:56.564778+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:17:56.564778+00:00","content_hash":"4a49b7cd60c1b4ab08f1741fa3ba2d5c26e9fdf6f7437200809bd4beb989f51f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}